  "details": "Streams, videos, old videos and new.  Even avatar search worlds.  Nothing loads, just gives me an error about \"Maybe it's the incorrect media type\" or something.\n\nThis has persisted for months.\n\nI have tried every fix under the sun it seems like, nothing works.  Even completely reinstalled the game, deleted every file from my PC I could find from VRC and it's still busted.\n\nIt doesn't work on quest standalone.\n\nIt doesn't work on desktop version.\n\nIt doesn't work on PCVR.\n\nIt doesn't even work on phone version.\n\nIt doesn't work on side accounts either.\n\nI'm starting to think I should JUST give up.",
